<table>
<tr><th></th><tdfirst><subtotal>Characteristic factor:</subtotal></tdfirst><td></td></tr>
<tr><td><subtotal>Outcome:</subtotal></td><td>Present</td><td>Absent</td></tr>
<tr><td>Positive</td><td><in>aa</in></td><td><in>bb</in></td></tr>
<tr><td>Negative</td><td><in>cc</in></td><td><in>dd</in></td></tr>
</table>

<p>Observed odds ratio = <inu>odds</inu><br />
Approximate power <in>pwr</in></p>
<block name="power">

<p><ci>Approximate (Woolf, logit) <inu>ci</inu>% confidence interval = <inu>ci_1</inu>  to  <inu>ci_2</inu> </ci></p>

</block>
<p>Conditional maximum likelihood estimates:<br />
Conditional estimate of odds ratio = <inu>eor</inu><br />
<ci>Exact Fisher <in>pc</in>% confidence interval = <inu>llf</inu>  to  <inu>ulf</inu></ci><br />
<pval>Exact Fisher one sided <inp>p1f</inp>, two sided <inp>p2f</inp></pval><br />
<ci>Exact mid-P <in>pc</in>% confidence interval = <inu>llm</inu>  to  <inu>ulm</inu></ci><br />
<pval>Exact mid-P one sided <inp>p1m</inp>, two sided <inp>p2m</inp></pval></p>

<block name="risk">
<p>Population exposure % = <inu>pe</inu><br />
